# What: Lists files Git must never track: dependencies, build output, coverage, local
#     env/credential files, SQLite DBs.
# Why: Prevents committing secrets (.env, default-env.json, .cdsrc-private.json) and large
#     generated artefacts.
# If missing or unlinked: node_modules, credentials and build output can be committed by accident;
#     the secret scan in CI would then fail.
node_modules/
coverage/
*.log
.DS_Store
.env
.env.*
default-env.json
.cdsrc-private.json
gen/
mta_archives/
*.mtar
*.sqlite
*.db
tmp/
out/
